{"id":"choque","lemma":"choque","pos":"noun","rank":1404,"glosses":["collision, shock (sudden, heavy impact)","shock (something so surprising that it is stunning)","electric shock (sudden burst of electric energy through something or someone)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃɔ.kɨ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"choques"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/02/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Jessie_Edwin_Lawrence-choque.wav","examples":[{"text":"Foi um choque.","en":"It was a shock.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/251437","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Que choque!","en":"What a shock!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/351438","words":[{"g":"that / what"},null]},{"text":"Ela morreu de choque.","en":"She died of shock.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to die","l":"morrer"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Foi um grande choque para mim.","en":"It was a great shock to me.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"large"},null,{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Isso foi um choque e tanto.","en":"It was such a shock.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"great"]]}]}